SUMMARY:That's Not Me Comedy Tour With Concrete & Jerry Garcia LIVE at The Depot
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Concrete & Jerry Garcia\nConcrete and Jerry Garcia are two of the most exciting names in the new wave of Latino comedy\, bringing their unique voices and hilarious perspectives to stages across the country on the That’s Not Me Comedy Tour. Both comedians have built massive followings through social media and live performances\, and their chemistry on stage is undeniable. \nConcrete is known for his bold\, unfiltered humor and high-energy delivery that keeps audiences on the edge of their seats. Jerry Garcia (the comedian) brings a sharp wit and storytelling style that perfectly complements Concrete’s intensity. Together\, they create a comedy experience that is greater than the sum of its parts. \nThe That’s Not Me Comedy Tour has been selling out venues across the country\, and Salt Lake City is one of the most anticipated stops on the tour. A Post Show Meet & Greet is available for fans who want to connect with the performers after the show. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM MDT \nVenue: The Depot\, 13 North 400 West\, Salt Lake City\, UT 84101 \nPhone: (801) 456-2800 \nAdd-Ons: Bottomless Soda upgrade and Post Show Meet & Greet available at checkout. \nAbout The Depot\nThe Depot is Salt Lake City’s premier live entertainment venue\, located at 13 North 400 West in the heart of downtown. Housed in a beautifully restored historic train depot\, the venue offers a unique blend of industrial character and modern concert amenities. \nWith a capacity of approximately 1\,100\, The Depot provides an intimate yet electric atmosphere that’s perfect for comedy shows. The venue features a full bar\, excellent sound system\, and a spacious standing floor with elevated viewing areas. Parking is available in nearby downtown garages\, and the venue is accessible via TRAX light rail. \nOperated by Live Nation\, The Depot is consistently ranked as one of the best mid-size venues in Salt Lake City. Doors typically open 60–90 minutes before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\nThe That’s Not Me Comedy Tour is a full-length comedy show featuring both Concrete and Jerry Garcia performing their best material. The show is high-energy\, culturally rich\, and packed with the kind of humor that resonates deeply with Latino audiences while bringing everyone else along for the ride. \nExpect hilarious stories\, bold observations\, and the kind of crowd interaction that makes every live show feel like a one-of-a-kind experience. The chemistry between Concrete and Jerry Garcia is electric — they play off each other in ways that elevate both of their performances. \nAn opening act will kick off the evening before the main show begins. Arrive early to grab drinks and secure your spot on the floor. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: Starting at $77+ \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster and authorized resale platforms. This show is expected to sell out — get your tickets now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thats-not-me-comedy-tour-concrete-jerry-garcia-live-at-the-depot/
LOCATION:The Depot\, 13 North 400 West\, Salt Lake City\, Utah\, 84101\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2f6ac2cb-18b8-48ec-8250-0e37221f5f91_CUSTOM-TFA7h6.jpg
