DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nEmil Wakim LIVE at The Bell House\nChicago-born\, Brooklyn-based comedian Emil Wakim brings his sharp\, high-energy stand-up to The Bell House in Brooklyn on Saturday\, August 15\, 2026. Known for his viral social media presence and appearances on major comedy stages\, Emil Wakim is one of the most exciting rising voices in stand-up comedy today. Catch him live in an intimate Brooklyn venue for a night of laughs you won’t forget! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\nAddress: 149 7th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nParking: Street parking available; nearby paid lots\nAge Requirement: 18+ (valid photo ID required) \nAbout Emil Wakim\nEmil Wakim is a Chicago-born\, Brooklyn-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and content creator who has built a massive following through his relatable\, high-energy comedy. He has performed at major comedy festivals and clubs across the country and has been featured on Kill Tony\, making him a fan favorite in the comedy world. His unique blend of observational humor and personal storytelling makes every show a memorable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nEmil Wakim’s signature high-energy stand-up comedy\nRelatable observational humor and personal storytelling\nAn intimate Brooklyn venue atmosphere at The Bell House\nA night of non-stop laughs from one of comedy’s hottest rising stars\nDoors open early — arrive early for the best spots\n\nVenue Information\nThe Bell House is a beloved Brooklyn music and comedy venue located at 149 7th St in the Gowanus neighborhood. Known for its warm atmosphere\, great sound\, and intimate setting\, The Bell House is one of NYC’s premier spots for live comedy and music events. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets start at $44 and are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. Only 26 tickets remaining — don’t wait to secure your spot! \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
