SUMMARY:Bruce Bruce LIVE at Beau Rivage Theatre
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nBruce Bruce LIVE at Beau Rivage Theatre\nComedy legend Bruce Bruce is bringing his explosive Cool Since Day One Tour to the Beau Rivage Theatre in Biloxi\, MS! Known for his larger-than-life personality\, infectious energy\, and hilarious observations about everyday life\, Bruce Bruce delivers a show that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Beau Rivage Theatre\nAddress: 875 Beach Blvd\, Biloxi\, MS 39530\nPhone: 1-888-566-7469 \nAbout Bruce Bruce\nBruce Bruce is one of the most beloved comedians in America\, best known for his appearances on HBO’s Def Comedy Jam and BET’s Comic View. With his booming voice\, infectious laugh\, and sharp comedic timing\, Bruce Bruce has been selling out venues across the country for decades. His unique blend of observational humor and physical comedy makes every show an unforgettable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a true comedy legend\nNew material from the Cool Since Day One Tour\nBruce Bruce’s signature larger-than-life stage presence\nA hilarious\, crowd-pleasing show for all comedy fans\nPremium entertainment at the iconic Beau Rivage Theatre in Biloxi\n\nVenue Information\nThe Beau Rivage Theatre is located inside the Beau Rivage Resort & Casino at 875 Beach Blvd\, Biloxi\, MS. The venue offers world-class amenities\, excellent sightlines\, and is one of the Gulf Coast’s premier entertainment destinations. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $66. Don’t miss Bruce Bruce live — this show is expected to sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
