SUMMARY:Madre Latina Peligrosa Pero Divina De Josue Comedy LIVE at Wilson Theater at Vogel Hall
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nJosué Comedy is a rising star in the Spanish-language comedy world\, known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and ability to connect deeply with Latino audiences across the United States and Latin America. \nHis show Madre Latina: Peligrosa\, Pero Divina is a love letter to the iconic Latina mother — fierce\, funny\, and unforgettable. Josué’s comedy blends personal anecdotes\, cultural observations\, and universal family humor that resonates with anyone who grew up in a Latino household. \nWith a growing social media following and sold-out shows across the country\, Josué Comedy is quickly becoming one of the most exciting voices in bilingual stand-up comedy. His performances are known for being warm\, hilarious\, and deeply heartfelt. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Wilson Theater at Vogel Hall\, 121 E. Wells St.\, Milwaukee\, WI 53202\nShow Language: Primarily Spanish with bilingual elements\nContent Warning: Adult themes and language — recommended for ages 18+\n\nAbout the Venue\nWilson Theater at Vogel Hall is part of the Marcus Performing Arts Center\, one of Milwaukee’s most beloved cultural institutions. Located at 121 E. Wells St. in the heart of downtown Milwaukee\, the Wilson Theater is an intimate and elegant venue with a capacity of approximately 500 seats. \nThe theater features excellent acoustics\, comfortable seating\, and a warm\, inviting atmosphere that makes it perfect for comedy performances. The Marcus Center complex is easily accessible from downtown Milwaukee and offers nearby parking in the Milwaukee Center Parking structure. \nThe Wilson Theater’s intimate setting means every seat feels close to the stage\, creating a personal and immersive experience for comedy fans. The venue’s classic design and professional production capabilities ensure a top-tier show experience. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy show featuring Josué Comedy performing his full-length special Madre Latina: Peligrosa\, Pero Divina. Expect a night of heartfelt laughs\, cultural celebration\, and stories about the Latina mother experience that will have the entire audience in stitches. \nThe show is primarily in Spanish\, making it a wonderful event for Spanish-speaking audiences and bilingual comedy fans. Whether you’re a longtime fan of Josué Comedy or discovering him for the first time\, this is a must-see performance. \nArrive early to find your seats and enjoy the intimate atmosphere of the Wilson Theater before the show begins. This is a seated theater event\, so expect a more relaxed and focused comedy experience. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $52.40 (standard tickets) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This show is expected to be popular with Milwaukee’s Latino community\, so purchase early to secure your seats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/madre-latina-peligrosa-pero-divina-de-josue-comedy-live-at-wilson-theater-at-vogel-hall/
