SUMMARY:Ron Funches: Funchadelic LIVE at Hollywood Improv (The Lab)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nRon Funches: Funchadelic LIVE at Hollywood Improv (The Lab)\nComedian\, actor\, and podcaster Ron Funches brings his “Funchadelic” show to the intimate Hollywood Improv (The Lab) stage on August 16\, 2026. \nKnown for his warm\, joyful comedy style and roles on Undateable and @midnight\, Ron Funches is one of the most beloved comedians working today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Hollywood Improv (The Lab)\nAddress: 8162 Melrose Avenue\, Hollywood\, CA 90046\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Ron Funches\nRon Funches is a comedian\, actor\, and writer known for his warm\, joyful comedy style. He has appeared on Undateable\, @midnight\, and Powerless\, and has released stand-up specials on Netflix. His podcast and social media presence have built him a devoted fanbase. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWarm\, joyful stand-up from one of comedy’s most beloved performers\nThe Funchadelic show — a unique comedy experience\nIntimate setting at the legendary Hollywood Improv (The Lab)\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nHollywood Improv (The Lab) is located at 8162 Melrose Avenue in Hollywood\, CA. The Lab is an intimate room perfect for up-close comedy experiences. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
