SUMMARY:Jamie Lissow: Better Off Dad Tour LIVE at The Wilbur
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nJamie Lissow is one of the most relatable and genuinely funny comedians working today. Best known as a regular contributor on Fox News’ Red Eye and as a writer and performer on Last Man Standing\, Jamie has built a devoted fanbase through his honest\, self-deprecating\, and brilliantly crafted comedy about family\, fatherhood\, and everyday life. \nHis Better Off Dad Tour is a love letter to the chaos\, joy\, and absurdity of being a dad — the kind of comedy that resonates deeply with parents while being hilarious to everyone. Jamie’s live shows are warm\, funny\, and packed with the kind of material that makes you feel like you’re hanging out with your funniest friend. \nWhether you’re a parent or not\, Jamie Lissow at The Wilbur is a perfect Sunday night out filled with genuine\, heartfelt laughs. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTickets from: $49\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater District at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that is perfect for Jamie’s warm and conversational performance style. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilbur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destinations on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the Theater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a warm\, hilarious\, and thoroughly entertaining evening of stand-up comedy as Jamie Lissow brings the Better Off Dad Tour to The Wilbur. This is a solo performance featuring Jamie’s signature blend of family humor\, self-deprecating stories\, and the kind of relatable comedy that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nSuitable for audiences 16 and older. A perfect late-summer night out for fans of honest\, heartfelt\, and genuinely funny stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $49. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jamie-lissow-better-off-dad-tour-live-at-the-wilbur/
