SUMMARY:Nurse John: Special Live Taping LIVE at Alex Theatre
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nNurse John: Special Live Taping LIVE at Alex Theatre\nNurse John is coming to the Alex Theatre in Glendale for a very special occasion — the live taping of his first stand-up comedy special. \nThis is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to be part of comedy history as Nurse John films his debut special in front of a live audience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM PDT \nVenue: Alex Theatre \nAddress: 216 North Brand Boulevard\, Glendale\, CA 91203 \nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Nurse John\nNurse John is a rising star in stand-up comedy who has built a massive following through his relatable\, high-energy performances. Known for his sharp wit and unique perspective as a healthcare professional turned comedian\, he has quickly become one of the most talked-about voices in comedy. \nThis special live taping marks a major milestone in his career. \nWhat to Expect\n\nThe live taping of Nurse John’s first stand-up comedy special\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy in an intimate theater setting\nA historic night — be part of the audience for his debut special\nThe beautiful Alex Theatre in Glendale\, one of LA’s most beloved venues\nAn unforgettable evening of laughs you’ll be able to say you were there for\n\nVenue Information\nThe Alex Theatre is a stunning historic venue located at 216 North Brand Blvd in Glendale\, CA. Built in 1925\, it features gorgeous Art Deco architecture and excellent sightlines from every seat. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $63. Secure your spot for this special live taping before they sell out. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
